 such as Netflix and YouTube into one viewing experience.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/04/19/rogers-communication-inc-rci-q1-2018-earnings-conf.aspx"},{"c":"RCI 2018 Q1","e":"rci","d":"2018-04-19","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Anthony Staffieri","x":"A couple of things: in the first quarter, we announced and implemented a price increase on internet -- depending on the speed tier the customer was on, it varied just to what that pricing increase was.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/04/19/rogers-communication-inc-rci-q1-2018-earnings-conf.aspx"},{"c":"RCI 2018 Q1","e":"rci","d":"2018-04-19","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"David Barden","x":"And then the second was that it looks like in the middle of February we saw a fairly uniform price hike in some of postpaid plan across the market which is kind of the reverse of the promotions we saw last quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/04/19/rogers-communication-inc-rci-q1-2018-earnings-conf.aspx"},{"c":"RCI 2018 Q1","e":"rci","d":"2018-04-19","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Anthony Staffieri","x":"I'll reiterate our guidance for the full year, it's still our guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/04/19/rogers-communication-inc-rci-q1-2018-earnings-conf.aspx"},{"c":"RCI 2018 Q3","e":"rci","d":"2018-10-19","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joe Natale","x":"As I have said before, customer service improvement and cost savings go hand in hand.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/19/rogers-communication-inc-rci-q3-2018-earnings-conf.aspx"},{"c":"RCI 2018 Q3","e":"rci","d":"2018-10-19","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joe Natale","x":"Yes, whenever you have multiple technology layers and multiple networks, there's always cost reduction as you decommission a network and repurpose a spectrum, etc. In the scheme of things, given the bandwidth consumption of machine to machine on 2G, it will produce some benefits in savings for us.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/19/rogers-communication-inc-rci-q3-2018-earnings-conf.aspx"},{"c":"RCI 2018 Q3","e":"rci","d":"2018-10-19","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Tony Staffieri","x":"For the year, with the solid progress we've made on the fundamentals and strong execution, we're raising our outlook for 2018 adjusted EBITDA growth to a range of 7% to 9% from our original range of 5% to 7%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/19/rogers-communication-inc-rci-q3-2018-earnings-conf.aspx"},{"c":"RCI 2018 Q4","e":"rci","d":"2019-01-24","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Joe Natale","x":"…a far greater cord-cutting rate, largely because of a couple of reasons, one is they've got much higher ARPU and prices around video entertainment and the proliferation of individual streaming services, etc., in the U.S. has kind of advanced cord-cutting with sort of combination of things.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/01/25/rogers-communications-rci-q4-2018-earnings-confere.aspx"},{"c":"RCI 2018 Q4","e":"rci","d":"2019-01-24","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Joe Natale","x":"We delivered on our key financial commitments and raised guidance in the third quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/01/25/rogers-communications-rci-q4-2018-earnings-confere.aspx"},{"c":"RCI 2019 Q3","e":"rci","d":"2019-10-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joe Natale","x":"We are seeing growing ARPU and data usage, notable cost saving opportunities and significantly happier customers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/23/rogers-communications-inc-rci-q3-2019-earnings-cal.aspx"},{"c":"RCI 2019 Q3","e":"rci","d":"2019-10-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joe Natale","x":"…that base, what do we see, we see a 50% reduction in the primary call drivers that we talked about, which is, bodes well for the future in terms of the cost reduction opportunity around propensity to call around, duration of calls everything we're seeing is lining up behind that very clearly.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/23/rogers-communications-inc-rci-q3-2019-earnings-cal.aspx"},{"c":"RCI 2019 Q3","e":"rci","d":"2019-10-23","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Jeffrey Fan","x":"But at the same time lowering the outlook is probably was not probably part of that plan.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/23/rogers-communications-inc-rci-q3-2019-earnings-cal.aspx"},{"c":"RCI 2019 Q4","e":"rci","d":"2020-01-22","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Joe Natale","x":"We launched global best-in-class WiFi Hub technology, introduced self-install, added Amazon Prime and Sportsnet NOW with more streaming services to come.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/22/rogers-communications-inc-rci-q4-2019-earnings-cal.aspx"},{"c":"RCI 2020 Q1","e":"rci","d":"2020-04-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tony Staffieri","x":"In addition, we are seeing the early signs of customers looking to downsize their packages with us in both Wireless and Cable as they right-size their spend to their new cash flow realities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/22/rogers-communications-inc-rci-q1-2020-earnings-cal.aspx"},{"c":"RCI 2020 Q1","e":"rci","d":"2020-04-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tony Staffieri","x":"The acceleration of that has -- and moving to 100% self-install is quite promising in terms of the customer experience, but also in terms of the cost reduction.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/22/rogers-communications-inc-rci-q1-2020-earnings-cal.aspx"},{"c":"RCI 2020 Q1","e":"rci","d":"2020-04-22","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Tony Staffieri","x":"And as a result, we are withdrawing our annual guidance that was originally provided in January.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/22/rogers-communications-inc-rci-q1-2020-earnings-cal.aspx"},{"c":"RCI 2020 Q1","e":"rci","d":"2020-04-22","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Tony Staffieri","x":"In terms of an outlook, we've withdrawn guidance because it's too difficult in the short term to predict the various combination of factors that could impact our financials.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/22/rogers-communications-inc-rci-q1-2020-earnings-cal.aspx"},{"c":"RCI 2020 Q2","e":"rci","d":"2020-07-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Tony Staffieri","x":"Additionally, we have delayed some price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/22/rogers-communications-inc-rci-q2-2020-earnings-cal.aspx"},{"c":"RCI 2020 Q2","e":"rci","d":"2020-07-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Joe Natale","x":"We had a price increases emotion, we halted it.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/22/rogers-communications-inc-rci-q2-2020-earnings-cal.aspx"},{"c":"RCI 2020 Q2","e":"rci","d":"2020-07-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joe Natale","x":"…are a number of activities that I would have called the business as usual, margin improvement, cost reduction activities driven by a number of things already being rationalized in our business, whether it's call volumes coming down 20% or digital adoption going up or some of the other sort of…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/22/rogers-communications-inc-rci-q2-2020-earnings-cal.aspx"},{"c":"RCI 2020 Q3","e":"rci","d":"2020-10-22","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Joe Natale","x":"…and tests, testings like network reliability, download and upload speed, call set up time, video streaming stability and quality, has awarded Rogers the best wireless network in Canada for the last two years. To get to this point has required CAD30 billion of investments in our wireless network…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/22/rogers-communications-inc-rci-q3-2020-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"RCI 2020 Q3","e":"rci","d":"2020-10-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Tony Staffieri","x":"As we highlighted last quarter, no price increases are in our Q3 results as we chose to defer increases earlier this year during the pandemic.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/22/rogers-communications-inc-rci-q3-2020-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"RCI 2020 Q3","e":"rci","d":"2020-10-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"David McFadgen","x":"So I'm just wondering, is there a theoretical tap for the EBITDA margin for Cable or you just think that this can continue to improve as people do more self-installs, and you can continue to put through price increases into the market?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/22/rogers-communications-inc-rci-q3-2020-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"RCI 2020 Q4","e":"rci","d":"2021-01-28","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Joe Natale","x":"In 2020, we introduced Ignite SmartStream, which offers customers their favorite streaming service all in one place.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/28/rogers-communications-inc-rci-q4-2020-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"RCI 2020 Q4","e":"rci","d":"2021-01-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Tony Staffieri","x":"In our cable business, we expect additional year-over-year growth in revenue, adjusted EBITDA, and adjusted EBITDA margins, as we benefit from efficiency gains and modest price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/28/rogers-communications-inc-rci-q4-2020-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"RCI 2020 Q4","e":"rci","d":"2021-01-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Tony Staffieri","x":"On the first one, very specific to cable and the sustainability of ARPA increases, I think a couple of things, the price increase had, I would say about a one-third impact of the ARPA, a contributor to one-third to the ARPA increase that you saw.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/28/rogers-communications-inc-rci-q4-2020-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"RCI 2020 Q4","e":"rci","d":"2021-01-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joe Natale","x":"Today, I will take you through some highlights of the quarter, followed by a discussion of our continued success in adopting to meet the needs of our customers, while streamlining costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/28/rogers-communications-inc-rci-q4-2020-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"RCI 2020 Q4","e":"rci","d":"2021-01-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joe Natale","x":"We accelerated our digital first plan and added self-serve options offering a better experience for customers, while streamlining costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/28/rogers-communications-inc-rci-q4-2020-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"RCI 2021 Q1","e":"rci","d":"2021-04-21","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Joe Natale","x":"Our degree of understanding an investment in AI and analytics has gone up substantially in the last 12-months with more to come.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/21/rogers-communications-inc-rci-q1-2021-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"RCI 2021 Q1","e":"rci","d":"2021-04-21","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Tony Staffieri","x":"Last year, we did introduce a price increase and that is certainly helping the year-on-year comparisons.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/21/rogers-communications-inc-rci-q1-2021-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"RCI 2021 Q3","e":"rci","d":"2021-10-21","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Joe Natale","x":"This was achieved despite our decision to postpone price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/21/rogers-communications-inc-rci-q3-2021-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"RCI 2021 Q3","e":"rci","d":"2021-10-21","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Paulina Molnar","x":"In our cable business, the company has not implemented any price increase in 2021.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/21/rogers-communications-inc-rci-q3-2021-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"RCI 2026 Q2","e":"rci","d":"2026-07-22","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Tony Staffieri","x":"That includes on certain plans, including Satellite, certain plans, higher-tier plans, including roaming, a number of initiatives that include savings on streaming applications.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/07/22/rogers-rci-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RCI 2026 Q2","e":"rci","d":"2026-07-22","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Tony Staffieri","x":"There are other value add propositions that I won't get into now, but as you described, network slicing does give us the opportunity to give customers priority access, whether it's video streaming or whether it's an experience in stadium during a concert where there's a lot of heavy traffic.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/07/22/rogers-rci-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RCI 2026 Q2","e":"rci","d":"2026-07-22","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Glenn Brandt","x":"As noted in our press release, we are reaffirming our 2026 outlook ranges associated with total service revenue growth, adjusted EBITDA growth, capital expenditures and free cash flow.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/07/22/rogers-rci-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RCI 2026 Q2","e":"rci","d":"2026-07-22","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Glenn Brandt","x":"To summarize, we delivered strong and disciplined results across all three businesses, advanced our sports monetization strategy, strengthened our balance sheet and reiterated our 2026 outlook.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/07/22/rogers-rci-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RCI 2026 Q3","e":"rci","d":"2026-10-23","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Tony Staffieri","x":"Sportsnet, Canada's number one sports media brand and streaming platform with the most valuable sports content, including national NHL rights for the next 12 years.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/23/rogers-rci-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RCI 2026 Q3","e":"rci","d":"2026-10-23","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Glenn Brandt","x":"Many broadband customers pay a service fee for broadband access only and are very important customers to us in driving service revenue because they enjoy streaming services, and that's what we were able to provide to them.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/23/rogers-rci-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RCI 2026 Q3","e":"rci","d":"2026-10-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Maher Yaghi","x":"I'll pass it on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/23/rogers-rci-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RCI 2026 Q3","e":"rci","d":"2026-10-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Vince Valentini","x":"I mean, churn of 3% for the quarter, 1% a month, it means 97% of your customers didn't leave after the price increase.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/23/rogers-rci-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RCI 2026 Q3","e":"rci","d":"2026-10-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tony Staffieri","x":"Against that backdrop, in answer to your question, do we see the CapEx envelope as being the right size?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/23/rogers-rci-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[33,1,9477,0,0,0,7251,1611],[35,1,8836,0,0,0,6778,1519],[36,1,8415,0,0,0,6729,1378],[39,1,11693,0,0,0,9824,1486],[40,1,9085,0,0,0,7543,1238],[41,1,10939,0,0,0,9713,928],[42,1,12545,0,0,0,10412,1716],[43,1,8722,0,0,0,7587,849],[44,1,11303,0,0,0,9727,1279],[45,1,8300,0,0,